translate HZIlle ep4_party_table_lucgb_f5b06f40:

#   luc "No, no. I, uh, just misplaced that app thingy... after a... you know, wild party."
    luc "No, no. Yo, eh, sólo extravié esa cosita de la aplicación... después de una... ya sabes, fiesta salvaje."

# game/episodes/Ep4/episode4.rpy:868
translate HZIlle ep4_party_table_lucgb_bfb678ae:

#   gb "You send party animal vibes all the way."
    gb "Envías vibraciones de fiestero hasta el final."

# game/episodes/Ep4/episode4.rpy:869
translate HZIlle ep4_party_table_lucgb_f243cdbe:

#   luc "Um, you know, I've been thinking... maybe, if it's not too much trouble, you could maybe get me another device?"
    luc "Um, sabes, he estado pensando... quizás, si no es mucha molestia, ¿podrías conseguirme otro aparato?"

# game/episodes/Ep4/episode4.rpy:871
translate HZIlle ep4_party_table_lucgb_9dec1bd4:

#   gb "Do I strike you as the candy dispenser here?"
    gb "¿Te parezco aquí el dispensador de caramelos?"

# game/episodes/Ep4/episode4.rpy:872
translate HZIlle ep4_party_table_lucgb_9dec7d19:

#   luc "Ummm... No. Maybe you could point me in the right direction."
    luc "Ummm... No. Quizá podrías indicarme la dirección correcta."

# game/episodes/Ep4/episode4.rpy:874
translate HZIlle ep4_party_table_lucgb_c8cf70b7:

#   gb "Listen, kid. I have no idea how you got your invite to this place, nor do I care."
    gb "Escucha, chico. No tengo ni idea de cómo conseguiste que te invitaran a este lugar, ni me importa."

# game/episodes/Ep4/episode4.rpy:875
translate HZIlle ep4_party_table_lucgb_44f90a1d:

#   gb "Going around blabbing to random people about... lost devices is not the right thing to do."
    gb "Ir por ahí cotorreando a gente al azar sobre... aparatos perdidos no es lo correcto."

# game/episodes/Ep4/episode4.rpy:877
translate HZIlle ep4_party_table_lucgb_8606586a:

#   luc "Then what am I supposed to do?"
    luc "Entonces, ¿qué se supone que debo hacer?"

# game/episodes/Ep4/episode4.rpy:879
translate HZIlle ep4_party_table_lucgb_4df10825:

#   gb "Go back wherever you came from."
    gb "Vuelve por donde has venido."

# game/episodes/Ep4/episode4.rpy:880
translate HZIlle ep4_party_table_lucgb_10aa1d1f:

#   luc "But... I need the money!"
    luc "Pero... ¡necesito el dinero!"

# game/episodes/Ep4/episode4.rpy:882
translate HZIlle ep4_party_table_lucgb_700d31e0:

#   gb "Kid, nobody cares."
    gb "Chico, a nadie le importa."

# game/episodes/Ep4/episode4.rpy:883
translate HZIlle ep4_party_table_lucgb_721b3d2a:

#   gb "This place doesn't seem too lenient when it comes to second chances. Once you mess up a job, it's pretty much a one-shot deal."
    gb "Este lugar no parece demasiado indulgente cuando se trata de segundas oportunidades. Una vez que estropeas un trabajo, es más o menos un trato de una sola vez."

# game/episodes/Ep4/episode4.rpy:885
translate HZIlle ep4_party_table_lucgb_2cbdd824:

#   luc "So I'm done..."
    luc "Así que he terminado..."

# game/episodes/Ep4/episode4.rpy:887
translate HZIlle ep4_party_table_lucgb_ab755a17:

#   gb "Try questioning people in a more natural way, ok? You might end up hearing more than fuck you."
    gb "Intenta interrogar a la gente de un modo más natural, ¿vale? Puede que acabes oyendo algo más que \"jódete\"."

# game/episodes/Ep4/episode4.rpy:888
translate HZIlle ep4_party_table_lucgb_d1eec588:

#   luc "Thank you. I will."
    luc "Gracias, lo haré."

# game/episodes/Ep4/episode4.rpy:903
translate HZIlle ep4_party_table_gb_7a4ae2d9:

#   mc "Well, well, well! Who do we have here?"
    mc "Vaya, vaya, vaya! ¿A quién tenemos aquí?"

# game/episodes/Ep4/episode4.rpy:905
translate HZIlle ep4_party_table_gb_f748df97:

#   gb "I could ask you the same thing. What a... lamb like you is doing in the lion's den?"
    gb "Yo podría preguntarte lo mismo. ¿Qué hace un... cordero como tú en la boca del lobo?"

# game/episodes/Ep4/episode4.rpy:906
translate HZIlle ep4_party_table_gb_edf548c9:

#   gb "Does the big boss know what you're up to?"
    gb "¿Sabe el gran jefe lo que estás tramando?"

# game/episodes/Ep4/episode4.rpy:913
translate HZIlle ep4_party_table_gb_607d9531:

#   mc "Of course! All my actions are big boss approved."
    mc "Por supuesto! Todas mis acciones están aprobadas por el gran jefe."

# game/episodes/Ep4/episode4.rpy:914
translate HZIlle ep4_party_table_gb_d1986275:

#   mc "Yours?"
    mc "¿El tuyo?"

# game/episodes/Ep4/episode4.rpy:916
translate HZIlle ep4_party_table_gb_82cd38c0:

#   gb "Duh!"
    gb "¡Duh!"

# game/episodes/Ep4/episode4.rpy:918
translate HZIlle ep4_party_table_gb_cec0ff9d:

#   gb "I'm all about keeping your ear to the ground when it comes to our enemies."
    gb "Soy partidario de mantener el oído atento cuando se trata de nuestros enemigos."

# game/episodes/Ep4/episode4.rpy:924
translate HZIlle ep4_party_table_gb_0ab2e7fc:

#   mc "Nobody can know, ok?"
    mc "Nadie puede saberlo, ¿vale?"

# game/episodes/Ep4/episode4.rpy:925
translate HZIlle ep4_party_table_gb_1f0ab9c3:

#   gb "Nobody will know."
    gb "Nadie lo sabrá."

# game/episodes/Ep4/episode4.rpy:927
translate HZIlle ep4_party_table_gb_ffca5f39:

#   mc "Totally our secret?"
    mc "¿Totalmente nuestro secreto?"

# game/episodes/Ep4/episode4.rpy:928
translate HZIlle ep4_party_table_gb_ebcfb61c:

#   gb "Guaranteed."
    gb "Garantizado."

# game/episodes/Ep4/episode4.rpy:930
translate HZIlle ep4_party_table_gb_b11bcbd3:

#   mc "He doesn't know."
    mc "No lo sabe."

# game/episodes/Ep4/episode4.rpy:931
translate HZIlle ep4_party_table_gb_69a17a78:

#   gb "So what are you up to?"
    gb "¿Qué te propones?"

# game/episodes/Ep4/episode4.rpy:933
translate HZIlle ep4_party_table_gb_544e65f1:

#   mc "Scouting for opportunities. You?"
    mc "Buscando oportunidades. ¿Tú?"

# game/episodes/Ep4/episode4.rpy:934
translate HZIlle ep4_party_table_gb_ec2bc938:

#   gb "... Avoiding trouble. Things got out of hand recently..."
    gb "... Evitando problemas. Las cosas se me fueron de las manos hace poco..."

# game/episodes/Ep4/episode4.rpy:935
translate HZIlle ep4_party_table_gb_1153a85a:

#   gb "But mostly I'm watching what our enemies are up to."
    gb "Pero sobre todo observo lo que hacen nuestros enemigos."

# game/episodes/Ep4/episode4.rpy:941
translate HZIlle ep4_party_table_gb_d4382962:

#   mc "Why don't you tell me first?"
    mc "¿Por qué no me lo dices a mí primero?"

# game/episodes/Ep4/episode4.rpy:942
translate HZIlle ep4_party_table_gb_afa34b17:

#   gb "Of course, he knows. I'm keeping my eyes on our enemies."
    gb "Claro que lo sabe. No pierdo de vista a nuestros enemigos."

# game/episodes/Ep4/episode4.rpy:944
translate HZIlle ep4_party_table_gb_ac313663:

#   mc "So am I."
    mc "Yo también."

# game/episodes/Ep4/episode4.rpy:947
translate HZIlle ep4_party_table_gb_36f1f131:

#   mc "So what is [hns] up to, then?"
    mc "Entonces, ¿qué trama [hns]?"

# game/episodes/Ep4/episode4.rpy:948
translate HZIlle ep4_party_table_gb_019b632e:

#   gb "Morph. Does that ring a bell?"
    gb "Morph. ¿Te suena?"

# game/episodes/Ep4/episode4.rpy:950
translate HZIlle ep4_party_table_gb_6cbefdc3:

#   mc "Yeah. The famous superdrug."
    mc "Sí, el famoso Superdrug."

# game/episodes/Ep4/episode4.rpy:951
translate HZIlle ep4_party_table_gb_fb110d3d:

#   gb "It's simple. If [z] controls the supply, we win."
    gb "Es sencillo: si [z] controla el suministro, ganamos."

# game/episodes/Ep4/episode4.rpy:953
translate HZIlle ep4_party_table_gb_be443e75:

#   gb "But not only am I competing with someone from [z]'s side, the app also has a contact..."
    gb "Pero no sólo estoy compitiendo con alguien del lado de [z], la aplicación también tiene un contacto..."

# game/episodes/Ep4/episode4.rpy:954
translate HZIlle ep4_party_table_gb_767b2f4e:

#   mct "... someone from [z]'s side...?"
    mct "... ¿alguien del bando de [z]?"

# game/episodes/Ep4/episode4.rpy:956
translate HZIlle ep4_party_table_gb_1a5e5b70:

#   mct "[gg]."
    mct "[gg]."

# game/episodes/Ep4/episode4.rpy:957
translate HZIlle ep4_party_table_gb_9fd3e2a1:

#   gb "I'm trying to give [z] the upper hand and all I get in return are obstacles!"
    gb "¡Intento dar ventaja a [z] y todo lo que obtengo a cambio son obstáculos!"

# game/episodes/Ep4/episode4.rpy:959
translate HZIlle ep4_party_table_gb_f66e6da4:

#   mc "Oh, really?"
    mc "¿Ah, sí?"

# game/episodes/Ep4/episode4.rpy:961
translate HZIlle ep4_party_table_gb_53c4b009:

#   gb "People may talk, but the big guy's story isn't over, and [hns] hasn't claimed the throne yet."
    gb "La gente puede hablar, pero la historia del gran hombre no ha terminado, y [hns] todavía no ha reclamado el trono."

# game/episodes/Ep4/episode4.rpy:963
translate HZIlle ep4_party_table_gb_a27f2ca4:

#   gb "Anyone thinking differently is delusional."
    gb "Cualquiera que piense de otro modo es un iluso."

# game/episodes/Ep4/episode4.rpy:964
translate HZIlle ep4_party_table_gb_f483bf57:

#   mc "I can't argue with that."
    mc "No puedo discutirlo."

# game/episodes/Ep4/episode4.rpy:966
translate HZIlle ep4_party_table_gb_d107b5dd:

#   gb "I see how you look at me..."
    gb "Veo cómo me miras..."

# game/episodes/Ep4/episode4.rpy:969
translate HZIlle ep4_party_table_gb_d45e2a31:

#   mc "Like I want to fuck you again?"
    mc "¿Como si quisiera follarte otra vez?"

# game/episodes/Ep4/episode4.rpy:970
translate HZIlle ep4_party_table_gb_6ff7a7e1:

#   gb "That, too. Not right now, though."
    gb "Eso también, aunque ahora no."

# game/episodes/Ep4/episode4.rpy:971
translate HZIlle ep4_party_table_gb_10105fd5:

#   mc "Tonight?"
    mc "¿Esta noche?"

# game/episodes/Ep4/episode4.rpy:973
translate HZIlle ep4_party_table_gb_6864b97b:

#   gb "Oh, absolutely."
    gb "Por supuesto."

# game/episodes/Ep4/episode4.rpy:974
translate HZIlle ep4_party_table_gb_c51a3b16:

#   gb "If I'm still alive..."
    gb "Si sigo vivo..."

# game/episodes/Ep4/episode4.rpy:975
translate HZIlle ep4_party_table_gb_d09c1ee9:

#   mc "So how do I look at you?"
    mc "¿Cómo te miro?"

# game/episodes/Ep4/episode4.rpy:977
translate HZIlle ep4_party_table_gb_fa074ff2:

#   gb "Like I'm the traitor."
    gb "Como si yo fuera el traidor."

# game/episodes/Ep4/episode4.rpy:978
translate HZIlle ep4_party_table_gb_829ca6fc:

#   mct "It's either you or me, according to [cl] and [r]."
    mct "Eres tú o yo, según [cl] y [r]."

# game/episodes/Ep4/episode4.rpy:980
translate HZIlle ep4_party_table_gb_d3227e6d:

#   gb "I'm not."
    gb "No lo hago."

# game/episodes/Ep4/episode4.rpy:981
translate HZIlle ep4_party_table_gb_1fc5b074:

#   mc "That's what a traitor would say."
    mc "Eso es lo que diría un traidor."

# game/episodes/Ep4/episode4.rpy:983
translate HZIlle ep4_party_table_gb_4b13a68b:

#   gb "The app's not my scene. It's more for rich folks playing shady games and clever young ones handling the deals."
    gb "La aplicación no es lo mío. Es más para ricos que juegan a juegos turbios y jóvenes listos que manejan los tratos."

# game/episodes/Ep4/episode4.rpy:984
translate HZIlle ep4_party_table_gb_96c8bae8:

#   gb "Me as a Slayer? Shoot people? Carry bombs? I can't do that."
    gb "¿Yo como Cazadora? ¿Disparar a la gente? ¿Llevar bombas? No puedo hacer eso."

# game/episodes/Ep4/episode4.rpy:985
translate HZIlle ep4_party_table_gb_9de18e8d:

#   mc "Hmmm... You've got a point. You thrive on contacts not... the manual labor."
    mc "Hmmm... Tienes razón. Tú prosperas con los contactos no... con el trabajo manual."

# game/episodes/Ep4/episode4.rpy:987
translate HZIlle ep4_party_table_gb_85630d82:

#   mc "In that case, you fit the 'rich' role."
    mc "En ese caso, encajas en el papel de \"rico\"."

# game/episodes/Ep4/episode4.rpy:989
translate HZIlle ep4_party_table_gb_8f9ec6b6:

#   gb "With a tiny detail that I'm not rich."
    gb "Con el pequeño detalle de que no soy rico."

# game/episodes/Ep4/episode4.rpy:990
translate HZIlle ep4_party_table_gb_f1474a47:

#   mc "Yeah, that can cause issues."
    mc "Sí, eso puede causar problemas."

# game/episodes/Ep4/episode4.rpy:992
translate HZIlle ep4_party_table_gb_3b402563:

#   gb "Anyway, who's that grumpy girl with you?"
    gb "De todos modos, ¿quién es la chica gruñona que está contigo?"

# game/episodes/Ep4/episode4.rpy:993
translate HZIlle ep4_party_table_gb_71703b38:

#   mc "[n]. My sister."
    mc "[n] Mi hermana."

# game/episodes/Ep4/episode4.rpy:997
translate HZIlle ep4_party_table_gb_bfebf624:

#   gb "Capable?"
    gb "¿Capaz?"

# game/episodes/Ep4/episode4.rpy:998
translate HZIlle ep4_party_table_gb_38b5e631:

#   mc "Oh, yeah."
    mc "Ah, sí."

# game/episodes/Ep4/episode4.rpy:1000
translate HZIlle ep4_party_table_gb_1d8d17c4:

#   gb "I may have a job for you two in the near future..."
    gb "Puede que tenga un trabajo para vosotros dos en un futuro próximo..."

# game/episodes/Ep4/episode4.rpy:1001
translate HZIlle ep4_party_table_gb_32c7a75b:

#   mc "A real one or another test?"
    mc "¿Una de verdad u otra prueba?"

# game/episodes/Ep4/episode4.rpy:1003
translate HZIlle ep4_party_table_gb_180178fc:

#   gb "I can't answer that right now... It depends."
    gb "No puedo responder a eso ahora mismo... Depende."

# game/episodes/Ep4/episode4.rpy:1004
translate HZIlle ep4_party_table_gb_9495ddef:

#   mc "On things like... if us two can outperform the entire [hns]?"
    mc "En cosas como... ¿si nosotros dos podemos superar a todo el [hns]?"

# game/episodes/Ep4/episode4.rpy:1006
translate HZIlle ep4_party_table_gb_d5dc7576:

#   gb "Nope."
    gb "No."

# game/episodes/Ep4/episode4.rpy:1007
translate HZIlle ep4_party_table_gb_fa3107e4:

#   gb "Keep your eyes on your personal offers. I'll be sending one soon."
    gb "Estate atento a tus ofertas personales, pronto te enviaré una."

# game/episodes/Ep4/episode4.rpy:1008
translate HZIlle ep4_party_table_gb_be2e5fdb:

#   mc "I will, thanks."
    mc "Lo haré, gracias."

# game/episodes/Ep4/episode4.rpy:1011
translate HZIlle ep4_party_table_gb_9f8ae35f:

#   gb "Step sister?"
    gb "¿Hermanastra?"

# game/episodes/Ep4/episode4.rpy:1012
translate HZIlle ep4_party_table_gb_cf1adef2:

#   mc "Yeah."
    mc "Sí."

# game/episodes/Ep4/episode4.rpy:1014
translate HZIlle ep4_party_table_gb_a0f289f7:

#   gb "Oh... Interesting."
    gb "Oh... Interesante."

# game/episodes/Ep4/episode4.rpy:1015
translate HZIlle ep4_party_table_gb_2876efd9:

#   mc "Why?"
    mc "¿Por qué?"

# game/episodes/Ep4/episode4.rpy:1018
translate HZIlle ep4_party_table_gb_8ed50916:

#   gb "Ah, shit!"
    gb "Ah, ¡mierda!"

# game/episodes/Ep4/episode4.rpy:1019
translate HZIlle ep4_party_table_gb_2558743e:

#   gb "I'm off!"
    gb "¡Me voy!"

# game/episodes/Ep4/episode4.rpy:1020
translate HZIlle ep4_party_table_gb_5dafc1e9:

#   gb "I need to talk to someone higher up the ladder. See you soon!"
    gb "Necesito hablar con alguien de más arriba. ¡Hasta pronto!"

# game/episodes/Ep4/episode4.rpy:1031
translate HZIlle ep4_party_table_lucti_8eee9d67:

#   ti "And? What did she say?"
    ti "¿Y? ¿Qué ha dicho?"

# game/episodes/Ep4/episode4.rpy:1032
translate HZIlle ep4_party_table_lucti_6bcc261e:

#   luc "We're done."
    luc "Hemos terminado."

# game/episodes/Ep4/episode4.rpy:1034
translate HZIlle ep4_party_table_lucti_55141983:

#   ti "Tell me what she said."
    ti "Dime lo que ha dicho."

# game/episodes/Ep4/episode4.rpy:1036
translate HZIlle ep4_party_table_lucti_ec69f618:

#   luc "That she doesn't just hand out the devices... And no second chances."
    luc "Que no se limite a repartir los aparatos... Y nada de segundas oportunidades."

# game/episodes/Ep4/episode4.rpy:1038
translate HZIlle ep4_party_table_lucti_4de2be6b:

#   ti "Like why...! Why the fuck was I cursed to work with a useless moron like you?"
    ti "¿Por qué...? ¿Por qué coño me han maldecido para trabajar con un imbécil inútil como tú?"

# game/episodes/Ep4/episode4.rpy:1039
translate HZIlle ep4_party_table_lucti_5cf6cfbe:

#   ti "You know if you had at least one ball, we'd get the job done!"
    ti "Sabes que si tuvieras al menos una pelota, ¡haríamos el trabajo!"

# game/episodes/Ep4/episode4.rpy:1041
translate HZIlle ep4_party_table_lucti_819521f6:

#   luc "It's not my damn fault you went for the kill when all we had to do was humiliate the man!"
    luc "¡No es culpa mía que fueras a por él cuando lo único que teníamos que hacer era humillarlo!"

# game/episodes/Ep4/episode4.rpy:1043
translate HZIlle ep4_party_table_lucti_4c74251e:

#   ti "Keep your mouth shut... I'll handle this!"
    ti "Mantén la boca cerrada... ¡Yo me encargo de esto!"

# game/episodes/Ep4/episode4.rpy:1044
translate HZIlle ep4_party_table_lucti_6e031ed2:

#   ti "Better yet, just get the fuck out of here."
    ti "Mejor aún, lárgate de aquí."

# game/episodes/Ep4/episode4.rpy:1046
translate HZIlle ep4_party_table_lucti_e4240560:

#   luc "Not a chance! I need this job!"
    luc "¡Ni hablar! ¡Necesito este trabajo!"

# game/episodes/Ep4/episode4.rpy:1048
